Vnum            11512
Name            裂魄零界座~
Description
零界座像整段零界深井最後一塊仍勉強還沒被削成空白的石影，腳下只剩一圈薄得近乎不存在的灰白環界，所有殘痕都在這裡被拖往更深的裂魄空白。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        11511
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        11601
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         零界座~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
